    "primary_cause": "Protection repeatedly lost initial Azil follower pickup while moving toward changing remote representatives. Avenger's Shield was on cooldown, the native rescue attempts did not produce a successful action in the decisive interval, and the runtime profile described native caster-centered Holy Wrath as enemy-targeted. That metadata forced the existing self-centered area readiness path to require target range instead of casting from useful ten-yard caster coverage. Threat aura remained uninterrupted, hazard exits were clean, the healer used legitimate threat-drop and defensive actions, this exact party had no Misdirection source, and the independently reconstructed eligible rows support the audit attribution."
